00:00:28.535 --> 00:01:39.895
Doran and Guy disobeyed the rules of the island and went to examine the tower straight away. Now they've been caught. And with Guy's lost memories being held hostage, it's time for him to make a hard decision. So all of you except Journey are on the east end of the island at Tower 13. There's a tense standoff between Doran and Guy who are currently facing down Poppy, Huber, and Shred.

