00:06:38.280 --> 00:07:01.440
<v John / Doran>This spell within a 20 foot radius, people can choose to fail their saving throw on purpose. If you fail, your, strong emotions will be suppressed, and, essentially, we can kinda bring it into, like, a from hostile or leaning towards hostile to a neutral situation. Yeah. So, anyone that's choosing to resist the spell would then make that saving throw against me, and it is a, Charisma saving throw.

